---
import Owner from './Owner.astro';
import { contact, routes, showFilm } from '../../i18n';

const mail = contact.email;
---

<p>This is a translation; the <a href={routes.privacy.pl} hreflang="pl">Polish version</a> prevails.</p>

<h2>1. Controller</h2>
<p>
  The controller of personal data collected by the Podoroж website (podoroz.art) is <Owner lang="en" />. Contact about
  personal data:{' '}
  <a href={`mailto:${mail}`}>{mail}</a>.
</p>

<h2>2. Contact form and e-mail</h2>
<ul>
  <li>
    <strong>Data:</strong> name, e-mail address, message; for a concert enquiry also the institution, phone number,
    proposed date, town and type of venue.
  </li>
  <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> to reply and, for a concert enquiry, to agree its terms.</li>
  <li>
    <strong>Legal basis:</strong> legitimate interest in answering messages (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR) and, for a concert
    enquiry, steps before entering into a contract (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR).
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Retention:</strong> until the correspondence ends or, if we sign a contract, until the limitation periods
    for claims expire.
  </li>
  <li>Providing the data is voluntary, but we cannot reply without an e-mail address.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Server logs</h2>
<p>
  The server records the IP address, time of visit, page opened and browser name to protect the site against attacks
  (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). Logs are deleted after 14 days. The server keeps the IP address of a form sender in memory for
  10 minutes to limit spam.
</p>

<h2>4. Recipients</h2>
<p>
  Data is processed on our behalf by Hetzner Online GmbH (server), Cloudflare, Inc. (traffic and mail forwarding) and
  Google (Gmail mailbox). Cloudflare and Google may process data in the USA under the EU–US Data Privacy Framework. We
  pass data to no one else.
</p>

<h2>5. Cookies</h2>
<p>
  The site uses no cookies and no analytics tools.{
    showFilm &&
      ' The YouTube film (youtube-nocookie.com) loads only after you click it; from then on Google processes data under its own rules.'
  }
</p>

<h2>6. Your rights</h2>
<p>
  You have the right to access, rectify and erase your data, to restrict its processing, to data portability and to
  object. Write to <a href={`mailto:${mail}`}>{mail}</a>. You may also lodge a complaint with the President of the
  Personal Data Protection Office (UODO, ul. Stawki 2, 00-193 Warsaw, Poland).
</p>
